Package: qc-webpanel
Version: 1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), qc-quadcapture
Maintainer: QUAD-CAPTURE Linux driver project <nobody@example.invalid>
Description: Web control panel for the Roland QUAD-CAPTURE
 Serves a browser UI on 127.0.0.1:8765 (standard and advanced modes) and
 talks to the qcctl daemon over /run/qcctl.sock. Requires qc-quadcapture
 for the patched module and the daemon.
